--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compatibility components (GPL-3.0-or-later)

The directory src/layouts/compat/ (the classic phonetic, smart phonetic and
Khipro .mim engines) together with the TSF parity ports
src/platform/windows/tsf/compartment.hpp/.cpp and
src/platform/windows/tsf/display_attribute_info.hpp/.cpp,
assets/dictionaries/ac.json and assets/layouts/bn-khipro.mim implement the
behaviour of the BornoTSF project (https://github.com/JayedAhsan/BornoTSF),
Copyright (c) Jayed Ahsan Saad and BornoTSF contributors, licensed under the
GNU General Public License version 3 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later). The
engines were re-authored for Suborno while preserving the upstream
behaviour; output parity with the original engines is pinned by the
regression suite in tests/unit/compat_parity_test.cpp (836 inputs x 3
engines, byte-identical). The behavioural provenance of the smart engine is
cppAvroPhonetic, Copyright (c) 2014-2015 Muhammad Mominul Huque, likewise
GPL-3.0-or-later, and the Khipro layout data is Copyright (c) 2024
rank_coder, licensed under the MIT license.

Because these components are licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later, DISTRIBUTING
this project (in source or binary form, including the Windows installer)
conveys the whole combination under GPL-3.0-or-later with respect to those
components and, per GPL-3 section 5, the combined work must be distributed
under GPL-3 terms. The SPDX headers inside src/layouts/compat/ and the
attribution headers of the TSF parity ports mark the exact file set.
Everything outside those files remains MIT as above.
